# Trivy config findings accepted for this gate, each with a reason.
# Read as: the finding is real, the remediation is impossible without breaking
# the component it describes.

# KSV-0053 "Exec into Pods" on ci/rbac/role.yaml -- the Kubernetes plugin works
# by execing the remoting launcher into each agent pod, which is what makes an
# agent ephemeral instead of a long-lived VM. The alternative (no pods/exec) is
# a Jenkins that cannot start an agent at all. conftest gates the rest of that
# file, verb by verb, in policy/.
KSV-0053
